{"Title":"An Act designating a certain overpass in the town of Stoneham as the State Trooper Tamar A. Bucci Memorial Bridge ","BillNumber":"H4123","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J27","Name":"Joint Committee on Transportation","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27","ResponseDate":"2023-10-12T10:37:44.06"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-10T13:13:49.8733333"},{"Id":"RMH1","Name":"Richard M. Haggerty","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RMH1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-05T14:41:57.3166667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4123/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The overpass identified by the Massachusetts Department of Transportation as bridge number S-27-008 on Marble Street located in the town of Stoneham shall be designated and known as the State Trooper Tamar A. Bucci Memorial Bridge in honor of Massachusetts State Trooper Tamar A. Bucci. The division of highways in the Massachusetts Department of Transportation shall erect and maintain suitable markers bearing that designation in compliance with the standards of the division.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to honor the memory of Trooper Tamar A. Bucci, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4123","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4123/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}